        "aspiration_text": "<p>We are building Scentiva for the moments that matter — the first impression, the bold decision, the celebration, the quiet confidence, and every new chapter in between.</p><p>Our ambition is simple: make fragrance feel personal, elevated, and inspiring enough to become part of who you are.</p>",
